# Upload only what the hosted site and webhook need. Vercel's CLI does not skip .env by default, so this allowlist
# keeps your keys (app/.env) and the operator scripts off Vercel.
/*
!api
!src
!public
!web
web/node_modules
web/dist
!vercel.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!.vercelignore
